**Movers vs baseline and vs last run:**

- **"observability maturity assessment" is the story.** The blog published 2026-08-09 is indexed and matching its target term inside eight days, at 20% CTR. First evidence in this plan that a purpose-built assessment page earns its keyword quickly. It is also a commercial-intent term.
- **"signal drop"** improved again (5.6 to 5.4) and holds page one, but returns 0 clicks against 124 impressions. Third consecutive run as the largest wasted page-one position on the site.
- **"what is grafana alloy"** is on a fourth consecutive read just off page one (10.5, 10.8, 10.7) with impressions rising sharply (69 to 99) and zero clicks throughout.
- **"grafana alloy"** short-tail returned with 1 click after dropping out last run.

