**Author pages, second run:** 14 of 53 clicks (26%) come from two author pages at 23.4% and 13.6% CTR. Best-converting surface on the site, duplicate URLs splitting one intent, no CTA to newsletter, free chapter or advisory. Unchanged since 08-10.

**Biggest impression sink:** /p/what-is-grafana-alloy at 683 impressions for 3 clicks, 11% of all site impressions at 0.4% CTR. The cost-strategy post (732 impressions last run) has dropped out of the top ten pages.

## Money pages

Read with the exact-URL filter form `&page=!<encoded-full-url>`. The `&page=*substring*` contains form silently returns "No data" and would produce false zeros (methodology fix recorded 2026-08-10).

| Page | Clicks | Impressions | CTR | Position | vs 08-10 |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| **/advisory** | 0 | **19** | 0% | **7.6** | 12 impr / pos 10.2. Impressions +58%, back onto page one |
| **/metrics-and-mayhem/free-chapter** | 0 | **3** | 0% | **36.7** | 2 impr / pos 39.5. Both improving |
| /products/metrics-mayhem-chapter-4 | 0 | 0 | 0% | n/a | Unchanged, no organic surface |
| /metrics-and-mayhem/book | 0 | 0 | 0% | n/a | Unchanged, no organic surface |

**/advisory ranking queries:** "allan mann" (0 clicks / 1 impr / position 9.0), "observability in banking" (0 clicks / 1 impr / position 50.0).
**/free-chapter ranking queries:** "getthefreechapter" (0 clicks / 1 impr / position 50.0).

**Advisory is the revenue line and it is moving without help.** Three consecutive reads: 5 impressions at 7.2, 12 at 10.2, 19 at 7.6. Impressions nearly quadrupled in a fortnight, position back inside page one, clicks still zero. At position 7.6 that is a title and snippet problem, not a ranking problem.

**Worth noting for the SEO radar:** "observability in banking" appearing as an advisory query lines up with the rising regulated-industry / privacy-by-design observability theme picked up in Section 6 of the health check. The advisory page already half-ranks for a term the trade press is pushing.
